  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> be the solution of the differential equation, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. If the numerical value of area bounded by the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>8</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> is equal to ________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>8</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/27c49707-df39-40fb-a2e5-f26b7ddcc385-image.png\" style=\"width: 376px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></msqrt></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>8</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></msqrt></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>8</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>C</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>8</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
